        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「图神经网络」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "图神经网络把神经计算推广到包含节点、边和关系的数据。通过在图上反复传递消息，它们学习节点、边或整个结构的表示。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-a-new-model-for-learning-in-graph-domains", "source-unisi-oai-2005-gnn-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "每个节点从邻居收集消息，更新自己的隐藏状态，并在下一轮分享新状态。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-a-new-model-for-learning-in-graph-domains"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 GNN 视为关系数据深度学习的基础框架。它的长期影响在于消息传递机制，如今用于化学、推荐系统、知识图谱和科学建模。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-the-graph-neural-network-model", "source-a-new-model-for-learning-in-graph-domains"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
